<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Middleware on Fulur</title><link>http://example.org/tags/middleware/</link><description>Recent content in Middleware on Fulur</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 13:04:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://example.org/tags/middleware/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MQ:四大主流消息队列对比分析与选型建议（Kafka、RocketMQ、RabbitMQ、ActiveMQ）</title><link>http://example.org/posts/middle_ware/mq/%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 13:04:52 +0800</pubDate><guid>http://example.org/posts/middle_ware/mq/%E5%9B%9B%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%89%E5%9E%8B%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE/</guid><description>&lt;p>在分布式系统架构中，消息队列（Message Queue, MQ）扮演着解耦、削峰填谷、异步通信的关键角色。常见的MQ包括 Apache Kafka、Apache RocketMQ、RabbitMQ 和 Apache ActiveMQ。每种 MQ 有不同的技术背景、设计目标与应用场景，本文结合官网资料、社区经验与典型实践，深入剖析四者异同，帮助工程师做出科学选型。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>